From 344367a607b4e49737641ac45a6076dd917890b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GTA2 port <port@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:00:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] port: co-op prediction: the page runs the match's ticks
 (Gta2Port_RbTick), plays this player's inputs at once and goes back to the
 last confirmed tick when the clock's bundles differ; a tick nobody sees skips
 the world draw but keeps the HUD's per-tick servicing; predicted ticks are
 silent

---
 Source/Game_0x40.cpp |  13 ++++-
 Source/winmain.cpp   | 135 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 146 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Source/Game_0x40.cpp b/Source/Game_0x40.cpp
index 92377fad..dd08f169 100644
